mapping "X8300.1" source="X8300" target="82313006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X8300 SNOMED CT 82313006 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides X83
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45590555) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4219484 = (sctid 82313006), the verified Athena crosswalk target for X83
        (ICD10 relationship 45590555 -> 4219484). Why this target: it is the authoritative standard
        concept the parent X83 maps to, and the SE subdivision is fully contained by it.
        mapping_type=broader (target subsumes the source). Confidence (high): verified crosswalk with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch. Athena-local research only.
        """
}
